    "intro": "__osrt1__:{\"version\":1,\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"strong\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Important:\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" CashPath is a personal-loan request and referral service, not a credit counseling agency, debt-management provider, debt-settlement company, lender, or financial adviser. Debt-management-plan participation, fees, creditor concessions, account treatment, and personal-loan terms vary. CashPath does not promise that either option will reduce cost, payment, debt, or credit impact. CashPath may receive referral compensation; see the \"},{\"type\":\"a\",\"href\":\"/p/advertiser-disclosure\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Advertiser Disclosure\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]}]}}",
    "is_visible": true,
