    "intro": "__osrt1__:{\"version\":1,\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"strong\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Important:\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" CashPath is a personal-loan request and referral service, not a lender, credit counselor, benefits agency, or financial adviser. CashPath does not decide whether any income source is acceptable to a provider and does not promise an offer, approval, amount, APR, fee, funding time, or repayment term. Provider criteria vary. This page provides general U.S. educational information and does not determine eligibility for public benefits or credit.\"}]},{\"type\":\"p\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"strong\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Advertiser disclosure:\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" CashPath is an advertising- and referral-supported service and may receive compensation when a visitor is connected with, or takes an action involving, a participating provider. That compensation does not make CashPath the lender and does not determine provider terms. See the \"},{\"type\":\"a\",\"href\":\"/p/advertiser-disclosure\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Advertiser Disclosure\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]}]}}",
